\doxysubsection{Detailed Description}
Source file for command processor module for smart sensor node. 

This module processes commands received via UART for a smart sensor node that measures temperature, relative humidity, and CO2 levels.

\begin{DoxyAuthor}{Author}
Ivan PAVOSEVIC, Enzo DOS SANTOS. 
\end{DoxyAuthor}
\begin{DoxyDate}{Date}
08 Apr 2025 
\end{DoxyDate}


